[I] Simple configuration-file parsing library in C

[T] dotconf is a small C library implementing a dot.conf style
[T] configuration-file parser, used by applications such as speech-dispatcher
[T] to read their runtime configuration.

[U] https://github.com/williamh/dotconf

[A] Lukas Schröder
